OL,3,CProgramme listings for TUE 16 DEC
OL,4,G1300FClassical Live
OL,5,     GStep into Vienna's golden age of
OL,6,     Gthe waltz with a live concert
OL,7,     Gfrom the BBC Philharmonic
OL,8,     GOrchestra and Mark Forrest
OL,9,     Gintroduces music from the Belfast
OL,10,     GInternational Arts Festival.
OL,11,G1600FComposer of the Week: Prokofiev
OL,12,     GKate Molleson follows Prokofiev
OL,13,     Gfrom bleak classrooms to a prize-
OL,14,     Gwinning triumph - and a storybook
OL,15,     Gending.
OL,16,G1700FIn Tune
OL,17,     GString quartet Music Box Strings
OL,18,     Gperforms live in studio. We also
OL,19,     Ghear from Paul Bettany -
OL,20,     Gdiscussing the role of Salieri in
OL,21,     Gthe upcoming Amadeus TV series.
OL,23,Vppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
