OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GTake time out with a 30-minute
OL,6,     Gsoundscape of classical music
OL,7,     Gwith a seasonal flavour.
OL,8,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,9,     GIan Skelly is at Glasgow's Royal
OL,10,     GConcert Hall for a jazz-infused
OL,11,     Gprogramme from the Royal Scottish
OL,12,     GNational Orchestra featuring
OL,13,     Gmusic by Rachmaninov, Gershwin
OL,14,     Gand George Anthiel.
OL,15,G2145FThe Essay: Accompanying Austen
OL,16,     GAntonia Quirke speaks to
OL,17,     Gcomposers who've scored original
OL,18,     Gmusic for Austen adaptations
OL,19,     Gabout their musical choices and
OL,20,     Galso about the music Austen
OL,21,     Genjoyed. Today: Rachel Portman.
